e has found some unseemly thing in her, that he shall…","source":"web"},{"ref":"Judges 6:17","note":"He said to him, “If now I have found favor in your sight, then show me a sign that it is you who talk with me.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Ruth 2:2","note":"Ruth the Moabitess said to Naomi, “Let me now go to the field, and glean among the ears of grain after him in whose sight I find favor.” She said to her, “Go…","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Samuel 1:18","note":"She said, “Let your servant find favor in your sight.” So the woman went her way and ate; and her facial expression wasn’t sad any more.","source":"web"},{"ref":"2 Samuel 14:22","note":"Joab fell to the ground on his face, showed respect, and blessed the king. Joab said, “Today your servant knows that I have found favor in your sight, my lord…","source":"web"}],"related":[],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}